<h2>The three limbs at a glance</h2>
<table class="law">
<tr><th>Limb</th><th>Who may invoke</th><th>Time (from receipt of award)</th><th>Tribunal&rsquo;s time to act</th></tr>
<tr><td>Correction of computation/clerical/typographical errors — s. 33(1)(a)</td><td>Any party, with notice to the other; tribunal may also correct suo motu within thirty days of the award — s. 33(3)</td><td>30 days (extendable by agreement)</td><td>30 days of receipt of request; extendable by the tribunal — s. 33(6)</td></tr>
